\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr; Seen Stable On High Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 April 1999\par 11:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar Friday morning, and dealers predict that the unit will remain around current levels for most of the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0915 GMT, the dollar was between ROL14,850 and ROL15,000, up from between ROL14,700 and ROL14,900 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said the leu remains stable as a result of increasing money market rates, which have led banks to invest more in leu deposits instead of buying dollars. The overnight money market rate was quoted at between 170% and 250% and the one-week deposit rate was between 170% and 280%. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said the market has been calm since the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets in an attempt to halt the fast depreciation of the leu. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman was quoted Friday in the media as saying the bank sold about $14 million Wednesday "to make the (\b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market) more functional." \par \par \uc2  So far this year, the leu has depreciated by about 27%, compared with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official target of 40% for the whole of 1999. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 02-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0924GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000