\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Stronger Vs Dlr Early; Slight Fall Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 204 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 April 1999\par 09:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is stronger against the dollar early Thursday but dealers predict that the unit might depreciate slightly over the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0710 GMT, the dollar was between ROL14,600 and ROL15,000, down from between ROL14,800 and ROL15,300 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu is stable in early trading as a result of the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets in an attempt to halt the fast depreciation of the leu. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen selling a "few million" dollars on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and attracted leu deposits at high rates to drain the leu liquidity and prevent banks from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the overnight money market rate was quoted at between 100% and 180% and the one-week deposit rate was at between 130% and 230%. \par \par \uc2  So far this year, the leu has depreciated 27.3%, compared with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official target of 40% depreciation for the whole of 1999. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0731GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4102j7e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760