\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  To Halt The Leu's Fall -Dealers \b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 15:54\par \uc2  Emerging Markets Report \par \uc2 EM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets Wednesday in an attempt to halt the fast depreciation of the leu (ROL), \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen selling a "few million" dollars on the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as the dollar was traded at between ROL15,450 and ROL15,650, dealers said. They also noted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  attracted leu deposits at high rates to drain the leu liquidity and prevent banks from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  attracted one week deposits at rates between 150% and 200%, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu depreciation sharpened midday Wednesday amid increasing dollar demand from importers. They said the heavy demand for dollars will maintain the pressure on leu in the coming days. \par \par \uc2  After \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar was traded at between ROL14,700 and ROL15,150 but the leu resumed its depreciation trend later and the market closed at between ROL14,800 and ROL15,300 a dollar. \par \par \uc2  So far this year, the leu has depreciated 27.3%, compared with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official target of 40% depreciation for the whole of 1999. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have a difficult task trying to support the leu in the coming three months when Romania must repay almost $1 billion in foreign debts. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were quoted at $1.5 billion at the end of last week. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  31-03-99 \par \par \uc2  1354GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument em00000020010827dv3v001mt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
