\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Further Depreciation Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 09:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Tuesday, with dealers predicting a further depreciation of the unit on heavy dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  At 0725 GMT, the dollar was between ROL15,000 and ROL15,250, up from ROL14,950 and ROL15,000 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu depreciated in early trading amid increasing dollar demand from banks that prefer to invest in dollars despite the high money market rates. The overnight money market rate was quoted early Tuesday at between 100% and 180%. The leu one week deposits rate was between 140% and 250%. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on money market Monday by attracting leu deposits at high rates to slow the unit's depreciation. They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again Tuesday to halt a major depreciation of the leu. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  late Monday sold only about ROL2 billion of its ROL188 billion three-month Treasury bill offer. The average yield was 80%. Dealers said that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market made T-bills unattractive for banks. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0739GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3u02io3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw18