\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Seen Depreciating Further \b0\par\par\uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 09:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Monday and dealers predict it is likely to continue depreciating amid lower money market rates. \par \par \uc2  At 0745 GMT, the dollar was between ROL14,850 and ROL14,950, up from ROL14,750 and ROL14,850 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu depreciated in early trading as decreasing money market rates led banks to invest in dollars. The overnight money market rate was quoted early Monday at between 70% and 130%, down from between 130% and 200% Friday. \par \par \uc2  Although the leu depreciation might deepen over the day, dealers said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't likely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by attracting leu deposits at high rates as it wants to protect the ROL1.83 trillion Treasury bill auction scheduled for Tuesday. High money market rates would increase the T-bills yields, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars to halt a major depreciation of the leu. \par \par \uc2  The leu appreciated by almost 1% last week after it fell 8.7% in the previous week. So far this year, the leu has depreciated 26.1%, compared with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official target of 40% depreciation for the whole of 1999. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 29-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0754GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji