\par\par \b \uc2  Exotic  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Focus: Romanian Leu's Fate Linked To Debt \b0\par\par\uc2  By Cristi Cretzan \par \uc2 731 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 17:48\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--A deep economic recession and fears the country may default on its foreign debts sent the Romanian leu (ROL) tumbling against the dollar this week. \par \par \uc2  The leu's fate now hinges on the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dwindling ability to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, and the government's success in negotiating fresh loans from the International Monetary Fund and World Bank. \par \par \uc2  The leu has fallen 10.3% against the dollar so far this week, and closed at ROL16,000 Thursday. A further sharp depreciation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could lead to inflation in excess of the 32% targeted by the government for 1999. \par \par \uc2  But the National Bank of Romania insists it has the power to halt the leu's decline. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  both on the money market and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to steady the leu," the bank's chief economist, Valentin Lazea, told Dow Jones Newswires. \par \par \uc2  So far this year, the leu has depreciated by 28.2%. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had planned to allow the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to depreciate by 40% during the whole of 1999. \par \par \uc2  Lazea said that the leu's depreciation was "normal" until this week. But he said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's decline since Monday was being driven by speculators. \par \par \uc2  "The normal value for the dollar would be between ROL14,000 and ROL15,000," he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par      Debt Repayments In May And June Crucial\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But with the government set to draw on \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves\par to meet heavy debt repayments this year, many market participants doubt\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's ability to defend the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The (\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central) bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  can not afford to spend the reserves," said Serban\par Ionescu, an analyst at Erste Bank in Bucharest.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The country must repay $1.54 billion of foreign debts this year, and\par find the money to cover a $2.3 billion current account deficit. But the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  had only $1.59 billion at the end of February.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par More than $800 million in principal and interest matures in May and\par June, when analysts and officials see another hard time for the leu.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Lazea didn't exclude major fluctuations of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at that time,\par similar to those experienced this week.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par However, he said Romania will meet its May repayments, which include\par $430 million in yen-denominated Samurai bonds lead managed by Nomura\par International and a $250 million Eurobond lead managed by Merrill Lynch.\par He said revenues from privatization will help preserve the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But in order for the government to be able to meet its debt payments\par and maintain some semblance of stability in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market,\par it will have to persuade the International Monetary Fund and the World\par Bank to resume lending.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The government is currently negotiating with the World bank a $300\par million loan to support the country's badly needed structural reforms.\par Conditional on the success of negotiations with the World Bank, an IMF\par team will return to Bucharest in April, when a letter of intent for a\par new stand-by loan might be signed.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par      Officials Stand By Inflation Forecasts\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Until there is clear sign of progress in these negotiations, the leu\par is likely to remain weak, analysts said. But further leu weakness will\par further damage an already stricken economy.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The leu's decline is threatening the (country's) macroeconomic\par stability," the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Lazea said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Speaking on national radio Thursday, National Bank Governor Mugur\par Isarescu said the leu's weakness was in part a response to the\par repatriation of $60 million of foreign investments in the Treasury bill\par market. He said foreigners no longer want to hold the country's domestic\par debt.\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dealers said the leu rallied against the dollar midday\par Thursday amid dollar sales by some state-owned banks. The leu resumed\par its depreciation trend later while the dealers predicted the market\par might calm down in the next days if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervenes\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on the\par market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par It may already be too late to meet the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's depreciation and\par inflation targets for this year, however, although officials are\par sticking to their forecasts for the time being.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "We remain at the same targets. Officially," the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's Lazea\par said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 fx\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .ro\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  03-18-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 11:48 AM\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dj00000020010827dv3i05nma\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
