\par\par \b \uc2  FOCUS- \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  C.Bank vows to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  on  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Ron Popeski \par \uc2 524 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 15:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, March 18 (Reuters) - The governor of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) pledged on Thursday to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  whenever required to support the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after its sharp plunge this week on volatile markets. \par \par \uc2  "We will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  when and where it is needed," Mugur Isarescu told parliament's upper house, the Senate, a day after the leu sank more than five percent against the dollar, its largest single-day decline this year. \par \par \uc2  Separately, Finance Minister Traian Remes said the country will "categorically" not default on debt servicing payments this year. \par \par \uc2  The leu started the day by resuming its fall from Wednesday's close of 15,500/17,000 to the dollar, and swung between 11,000 and 16,000/18,000 at midday before being quoted at 15,000/17,000 in mid-afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Most dealers said the BNR was trying to sell some treasury notes from its portfolio but no deals appear to have been done. There was no apparent direct \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which started the New Year at about 11,000 to the dollar, has been battered by poor economic performance and large trade deficits. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials say a correction is required as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has appreciated in real terms in the past two years due to high capital inflows. \par \par \uc2  Remes told reporters a promised plan to redress the leu's situation would be ready next week. He said he had "no moral right" to disclose details as this could affect markets at a critical point for the leu. \par \par \uc2  Isarescu said the bank had taken no action during Wednesday's big drop. The Finance Ministry had had to honour redemption of $60 million in domestic bonds, he said. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was now working with a projected leu depreciation of about 40 percent, compared to 31-32 percent as set down in the 1999 budget. Markets would quickly calm down and the depreciation would be more gradual from next month. \par \par \uc2  Analysts have expressed concern about Romania's ability to meet servicing of more than $2 billion in public debt, with a peak in May and June. The government is negotiating a new loan arrangement with the World Bank, a pre-requisite for further credits from the International Monetary Fund. \par \par \uc2  On Bucharest streets, the leu rebounded slightly at exchange offices from Wednesday's selling quotes of up to 23,000. \par \par \uc2  Passersby gaped at rates posted on billboards and calculated out loud the prices of imported goods. Dozens of shops selling appliances shut their doors and declared a day of stock-taking. \par \par \uc2  "How much do you think they will push up the price of a mobile phone?" one young man asked a friend. \par \par \uc2  Small queues formed outside banks of depositors trying to change leu deposits into hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Former Prime Minister Petre Roman, now Senate Chairman and leader of the Social Democrats, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to protect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against speculation. \par \par 