\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 10:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Tuesday, with dealers predicting the leu will fluctuate in hectic trading. \par \par \uc2  At 0915 GMT, the dollar was between ROL14,000 and ROL14,100, up from ROL13,850 and ROL13,950 from late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu began falling sharply in early trading but its depreciation was slowed by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the dollar traded around ROL14,100 and moved to attract leu deposits with high rates. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate was quoted early Tuesday at between 200% and 300%, while the rate for week deposits was around 200%. \par \par \uc2  "The market is very nervous and each small transaction may have a major impact on the leu," said a dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest. He said that market operators are worried that the leu continues to depreciate despite the high rates on the money market. \par \par \uc2  "We don't know how much the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can control the leu anymore," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Last week, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said that the "nervous depreciation" of the leu will halt around the end of March and will be followed by a "gradual depreciation" in April. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees a 40% depreciation of the leu this year, based on 32% annual inflation. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0924GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3g02444\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
