\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Seen Depreciating \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 09:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday, with dealers predicting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to fall during the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0815 GMT, the dollar was between ROL13,600 and ROL13,650, up from between ROL13,500 and ROL13,600 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu fell sharply Wednesday on low money-market rates, which were between 40% and 70% late Wednesday. The overnight money market rate is steady at those levels Thursday, but it is significantly lower than the more than 150% rate early Tuesday and nearly 400% Monday. \par \par \uc2  Money market rates increased dramatically Monday following the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week when it attracted leu deposits at high rates to halt the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rapid fall, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that only a massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could halt the leu's fall Thursday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said earlier this week that the "nervous depreciation" of the leu will halt around the end of March and will be followed by a "gradual depreciation" in April. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sees a 40% depreciation of the leu this year, based on 32% annual inflation. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197 ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones New