1ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0840GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3a01vxw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
