\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Amid Falling Money Mk Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 09:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Tuesday, with dealers predicting it will continue to fall during the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0820 GMT, the dollar was between ROL13,070 and ROL13,130, up from between ROL13,000 and ROL13,100 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu will resume its downward trend amid falling money market rates. The overnight money market rate dropped to between 150% and 170% Tuesday after it was quoted as high as 400% Monday. \par \par \uc2  Money market rates increased dramatically Monday following the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week when it attracted leu deposits at high rates to halt the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rapid fall, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The high rates diverted banks from investing in dollars, a dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said. But as rates fall, the banks will resume investing in dollars, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said that the economy can't support high interest rates for long as they lead to an increase in Treasury bill yields and make financing the budget deficit very expensive. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu was quoted earlier as saying that the leu would stabilize in April. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 09-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0833GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3901v2r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\p