\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Dn Vs Dlr Early Amid  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 221 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 09:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Friday, with dealers saying it will continue its downward trend despite reported \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0830 GMT, the dollar was between ROL13,420 and ROL13,460, up from between ROL13,370 and ROL13,420 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu fell in early trading on heavy dollar demand from both banks and importers. They said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market early Friday, though it had little effect. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  attracted leu deposits at high rates to divert banks from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  also Thursday, when it sold $15 million to calm down the leu depreciation. The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  occurred as the dollar was trading near ROL13,400. But dealers noted that the leu resumed its fall in less than an hour. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials continue to say that the leu depreciation will slow in coming days but dealers said the trend can be stopped only by massive \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market was quoted at about 40% Friday, up from 10% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401)210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 05-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0859GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3501qig\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
