\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dollar In Hectic Early Trade \b0\par\par\uc2 207 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 10:28\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday in hectic trading amid speculation it has further to fall. \par \par \uc2  At 0820 GMT, the dollar was between ROL13,280 and ROL13,320, up from between ROL13,080 and ROL13,120 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu fell sharply in early trading on heavy dollar demand from both banks and importers. They said the depreciation will increase dramatically unless the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  vaguely in early business, when it attracted some money deposits at high rates. But dealers said the market needs a major \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the leu's fall. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said the leu's fast depreciation in recent days was caused by the negative influence of rising gasoline and energy prices. The bank's spokesman was quoted as saying, however, that the depreciation will slow in coming days. \par \par \uc2  Money market rates remained low, encouraging the banks to opt for investments in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market was quoted at about 10% Thursday, almost unchanged. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401)210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0928GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3401q89\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\pics