\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Eyed \b0\par\par\uc2 304 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 09:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Wednesday amid speculation it will continue to fall sharply unless the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0830 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL13,060 and ROL13,100, up from between ROL12,975 and ROL12,995 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu resumed its fast depreciation trend in early trading on heavy dollar demand from both banks and importers. The money market remained low, encouraging the banks to opt for investments in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market was quoted at about 10% Wednesday, almost unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers expect the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the leu. He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market to attract leu deposits at high rates to divert banks' attention from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  strongly Friday, when it sold about $35 million to calm the fast depreciation of the leu, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers noted however that it is unlikely the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will sell dollars again as \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves are badly needed to help Romania meet its foreign debt servicing. At the end of February, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  were $1.59 billion dollars. \par \par \uc2  In the first two months of this year, the leu has depreciated by 14.27% against the dollar, making it unlikely the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will reach its target of 35% annual depreciation of the leu in 1999. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said the leu will be more stable in March although it is seen continuing to fall. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0854GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3301mfm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
