\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Seen Stable \b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 09:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Monday, though dealers say it might remain stable for the rest of the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0835 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL12,750 and ROL12,850, up from between ROL12,700 and ROL12,750 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu was relatively stable in early trading, following massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at least three times on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, selling about $35 million to calm the fast depreciation of the leu, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The leu fell sharply in February by nearly 10%, following a 6% fall in January. Dealers said the depreciation was caused mainly by speculative moves from banks. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu might resume its depreciation in the coming days. Amid prospects for a new stand-by agreement with the International Monetary Fund in June, some dealers believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should meantime encourage a weaker leu in order to narrow the current account deficit. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu said last week that the leu will be more stable in March and predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will meet the target of 35% annual depreciation of the leu. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 01-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0854GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3101llu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
