\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  C.Bank makes new  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  to prop leu. \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 13:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Feb 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) sold dollars in a second wave of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank market on Friday to prop the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after initial sales pulled it out of a sharp downswing, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The leu climbed to 12,720/850 to the dollar after the second move. The initial \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had hoisted the leu to 12,830/900 from a low in early trading of 12,960/13,000. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR spent a total of around $40 million in both waves to push leu bids firmer," said one dealer with a foreign bank. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials were unavailable to comment. \par \par \uc2  The leu had slipped at the opening of trade to 12,930/80 to the dollar from Thursday's close of 12,860/900. \par \par \uc2  It was the second day in a row that the BNR had stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to defend the leu against what dealers said were speculative purchases of dollars by banks. The bank drained leu funds on the money market on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been falling steadily in recent months under the careful watch of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which says it ended 1998 overvalued. It opened the New Year trading near 11,000. \par \par \uc2  Pressure has intensified this week following the resignation of top executives at leading state bank Bancorex. ((Radu Marinas, Bucharest Newsroom +40 1 312-0264 fax +40 1 315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). REUTERS. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv2q03okw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
