\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2 /Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  -2: IMF Deal Raise Concerns \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 17:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu said this week that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  avoided \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market earlier this month because it wanted to adjust the leu's depreciation in line with the consumer price index. \par \par \uc2  He said CPI is expected to raise to about 5% next month because of price hikes for energy and fuels. Isarescu said the leu will be more stable in March and predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will reach its 35% annual depreciation target in 1999. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers are more pessimistic, however, saying the leu's depreciation will at least double at the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  The IMF's decision Friday to consider a financial support for Romania in early April and to look for signing a new agreement with the government in June added more concerns for dealers. \par \par \uc2  "We will have another few months of uncertainty and this won't make the market much calmer," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He said it will be hard to keep the leu stable at the beginning of March, when usually dollar demand from importers will rise. \par \par \uc2  Dealers doubt that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be willing to spend from its hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to stop the leu's fall. Isarescu said Thursday reserves were at $1.6 billion and $920 million in gold. \par \par \uc2  "If they spend the reserve to support the leu, how will they pay the foreign debts," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-02-99 \par \par \uc2  1642GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2q01iwo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
