\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  To Halt Leu's Fast Fall \b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 17:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday on the interbank market to halt the leu's fast fall, but dealers doubt the market's return to tranquility will last long. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at least three times on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, selling about $35 million to calm down the depreciation of the leu (ROL), dealers said. \par \par \uc2  As a result, the dollar closed the session at between ROL12,700 and ROL12,750, down from between ROL12,960 and ROL13,010 at the opening. \par \par \uc2  "The leu might resume its depreciation trend next week," said a dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. "The market is too nervous and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will need to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  successively for a few days to stop banks from investing in dollars," he added. \par \par \uc2  The leu depreciated sharply in February by nearly 10% in February, following a 6% fall in January. Dealers said the depreciation was caused mainly by speculative moves from banks, encouraged by the lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Market's anxiety rose this week after the board of the country's largest bank, the Romanian Bank for Foreign Trade (Bancorex) resigned, saying it failed to find a feasible program to reform the bank. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 26-02-99 \par \par \uc2  1602GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2q01iqr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
