\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Further Depreciation Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Februar 1999\par 09:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Friday, and dealers are predicting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to fall until there is massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0750 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL12,960 and ROL13,010 up from between ROL12,860 and ROL12,920 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu continued to fall sharply in early trading despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday that had temporarily slowed its depreciation. The leu fell mainly because of speculative trading by banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen selling about $10 million on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Thursday and attracting leu deposits at high rates in a bid to halt the leu's fast depreciation. \par \par \uc2  Money market rates rose Friday, with the overnight rate at about 50%, up from around 10% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said the market needs major \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  for calm to return. But there were doubts about whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would spend its precious reserves on supporting the leu, considering Romania's high foreign debt service this year. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu said late Thursday in a live television program that the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves are around $1.6 billion. He also predicted that the leu would stabilize in March. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0813GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2q01gtc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
