\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Ctrl Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 1999\par 09:26\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday and is expected to continue depreciating until the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt its fall, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0810 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL12,900 and ROL12,970 from between ROL12,780 and ROL12,900 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu fell sharply in early trading on speculative moves by banks, and that only \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will slow its fall. \par \par \uc2  Money market rates remained low, with the overnight rate at about 10%, down from around 20% Wednesday. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu said Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hadn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market because the leu's depreciation has to be adjusted in line with the consumer price index, which he estimated will raise to about 5% next month because of price hikes for energy and fuels. \par \par \uc2  "In my opinion this correction (of the leu) is almost complete and, in the next period, the leu will be more stable," Isarescu said. He said the leu's depreciation has helped to narrow Romania's current account deficit by lowering the trade deficit. \par \par \uc2  Isarescu also said the leu was hurt by concerns over Bancorex. As reported, the Bancorex board resigned Tuesday after it failed to present a feasible plan for the bank's restructuring. \par \par \uc2  The restructuring of Bancorex, which is plagued by bad loans, is a key condition imposed by the International Monetary Fund and the World Bank for signing new financial arrangements with the government. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 25-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0826GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2p01kts\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
