\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early On Concerns Over Bancorex \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Februar 1999\par 09:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Wednesday and is expected to continue depreciating amid uncertainties over the fate of the largest state bank, Bancorex, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL12,665 and ROL12,695, up from between ROL12,540 and ROL12,580 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu fell sharply in early trading. "Everybody is buying dollars," a dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said, adding that the dollar demand was encouraged by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the few past days. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday to halt the leu's fast depreciation. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said heavy dollar demand was also caused by the situation surrounding Bancorex, whose board resigned Tuesday after failing to present a feasible plan to reform the bank. \par \par \uc2  The restructuring of Bancorex, which is plagued by bad loans, is a key condition imposed by the International Monetary Fund and the World Bank for signing new financial arrangements with the government. \par \par \uc2  "The lack of news on how Bancorex will be reformed is making the market nervous," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The government and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may appoint a new board for Bancorex Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  On money markets, overnight rates dropped to around 50% Wednesday, from 75% Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0823GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2o01ggf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
