\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early On Dropping Money Mkt Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Februar 1999\par 09:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Wednesday, with dealers saying the unit might continue to fall through the day on declining money market rates. \par \par \uc2  At 0805 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL12,195 and ROL12,215, up from ROL12,160 and ROL12,190 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu depreciated in early trading following an increase of the leu liquidity caused by the drop in money market rates. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate dropped to around 80% Wednesday from 110% Tuesday. The rates rose last week to as high as 200% for overnight deposits as the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the leu's fast fall. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  attracted leu deposits at high rates to divert the banks from investing in dollars. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market last week, selling dollars to control the leu depreciation, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers predict the leu will resume its fast depreciation trend if the money market continues to remain at low levels. \par \par \uc2  The leu's value fell by almost 6% in January. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0839GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2h01a2w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\png