\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Further Fall Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Februar 1999\par 09:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Monday, with dealers predicting a further depreciation by the end of the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0815 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL12,170 and ROL12,200, up from ROL12,150 and ROL12,180 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu was stable in early trading but predicted the unit might resume its depreciation trend following the drop in money market rates. \par \par \uc2  With leu liquidity increasing, the banks were expected to resume their investments in hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate dropped to around 120% Monday from 150% Friday. The rates rose last week to as much as 200% for overnight deposits, as the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the leu's fast fall. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  attracted leu deposits at high rates to divert the banks attention from investing in dollars. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market last week, selling dollars to control the leu depreciation, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the leu's evolution this week might be much calmer than previous weeks, as the market eyes the government's negotiations with the International Monetary Fund for a new stand-by loan. \par \par \uc2  The Fund's support is essential for Romania to be able to meet its foreign debts payment this year, when more than $2.2 billion must be returned. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0835GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2f017ip\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
