\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Up Vs Dlr Early On High Money Market Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Februar 1999\par 10:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is stronger against the dollar early Friday as high money market rates make investments in leu deposits more attractive, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0810 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL12,160 and ROL12,190, down from ROL12,200 and ROL12,230 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu was stable in early trading following the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on both \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money market Thursday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen selling dollars and attracting leu deposits at high rates to halt the fast fall of the leu. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  occurred as the dollar was traded for more than ROL12,250, dealers noted. It was the second time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week to support the leu. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to around 150% Friday, from 100% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu may resume its depreciation trend later Friday but at a lower speed. \par \par \uc2  The leu fell by almost 5% last week, after it slipped 6% in January. So far in 1999 the leu has depreciated by 9.6%, compared with 45.9% in 1998. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0918GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2