\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early On Heavy Dollar Demand \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Februar 1999\par 09:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday on heavy dollar demand from banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT, the dollar was trading at between ROL12,275 and ROL12,295, down from ROL12,130 and ROL12,160 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu fell sharply in early trading as banks rushed to buy dollars on spot with payment on Tuesday. The move allows banks to take profit next week if the leu depreciates further. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu might resume the depreciation trend that was stopped by the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on both \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets to halt the leu's fast fall. \par \par \uc2  On the money market, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  attracted leu deposits at high rates, making investments in leu more profitable than those in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The leu fell by almost 5% last week, after it slipped 6% in January. So far in 1999 the leu has depreciated by 9.6%, compared with 45.9% in 1998. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate dropped to around 100% Thursday, from 150% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0837GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2b0144w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\pic