\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Further Fall Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Februar 1999\par 09:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Monday with dealers predicting further falls by the end of the day on heavy demand for dollars. \par \par \uc2  At 0810 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL12,280 and ROL12,310, up from ROL12,210 and ROL12,240 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said the pressure on the leu is high in early trading. He said the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market by attracting leu deposits at high rates to divert banks' attention from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to around 130% early Monday after it opened at around 110%. \par \par \uc2  However, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had little effect on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, so far, the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market by selling dollars to halt the fast fall of the leu. In a similar move, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $15 million last week to stop the leu's slide against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is deliberately letting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciate to stimulate exports and thus narrow the rising trade deficit. The trade deficit in the 11 months to November rose to $3.06 billion from $2.29 billion a year earlier. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretza.ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0827GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2800ynz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
