\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Further Falls Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 293 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Februar 1999\par 09:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Wednesday on heavy dollar demand, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  expected to continue to fall unless the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL12,085 and ROL12,100, up from ROL12,040 and ROL12,060 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The leu fell sharply in early trading, with the market flooded with dollar buying orders and no sales. \par \par \uc2  "Everyone is buying, nobody selling. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  must take a decision to halt this trend," a dealer at a foreign bank in Bucharest said. He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should try to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market by attracting leu deposits at high rates to divert banks' interest in dollar investments. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold small amounts of dollars Tuesday to calm the market, but the leu resumed its downtrend after a short period of stagnation, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The leu's sharp fall since the start of the week has resulted in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciating by a total of 2.88% in the past two days. Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is deliberately letting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciate to stimulate exports and thus narrow the rising trade deficit. \par \par \uc2  The latest statistics showed the trade deficit in the 11 months to November rose to $3.06 billion from $2.29 billion a year earlier. \par \par \uc2  Traders also said that the leu's rapid depreciation isn't a cause for concern as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has enough reserves to control the decline. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate remained at around 70% Wednesday, unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-02-99 \par \par \uc2  0819GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv2300un6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
