\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Slight Depreciation Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 233 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Januar 1999\par 09:47\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Monday, with dealers predicting some slight depreciation by the end of the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0815 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL11,360 and ROL11,375, up from ROL11,310 and ROL11,320 at Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu fell sharply against the dollar in early trade, on high dollar demand from importers. The dealer said the market might calm down later but predicted a slight depreciation by the end of the session. \par \par \uc2  However, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers predicted the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell dollars in order to halt any major depreciation of the leu and preserve future \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were quoted at $1.8 billion as of Jan. 13, up from around $1.66 billion at the end of December. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials predicted the leu will depreciate by a maximum 35% this year. \par \par \uc2  On the money market, leu liquidity is high, with the overnight money market rate at around 45%, unchanged from late Friday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen attracting leu deposits Friday, in order to try and drain the leu's liquidity. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 18-01-99 \par \par \uc2  0847GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv1i00dq6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
