\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Stronger Vs Dlr Early; Seen Slipping \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Januar 1999\par 10:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly stronger against the dollar early Monday, but dealers predict the leu will resume its downward trend on heavy dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  At 0845 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL11,070 and ROL11,110, down from between ROL11,150 and ROL11,300 in late Thursday trading. \par \par \uc2  The leu is expected to slip in the course of Monday's trading on dollar demand from importers and lack of substantial dollar offer from exporters, a dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said. \par \par \uc2  The leu fell sharply against the dollar last week on dollar demand from both importers and banks interested in dollar deposits for the New Year holiday, the dealer said. The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  and selling dollars to halt the leu's fast fall. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  last week at more than $40 million. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect little change for the leu after the launch of euro as Romanian foreign trade is made mostly in dollars. Some dealers said there might be an effect on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decides to keep a part of its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves in euro. \par \par \uc2  The European Union Commission fixed the euro against the Romanian leu at ROL12,813.9. \par \par \uc2  In the money market, the overnight rate remained at around 40% Monday, little changed from last week. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197;