\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Steady Vs Dlr Early On High Money Market Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 239 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Dezember 1998\par 09:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is steady against the dollar early Monday, with dealers predicting a calm trading day amid high money market rates. \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL10,550 and ROL10,610, little changed from Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu is expected to remain stable over the day as high rates on money market diverts banks from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose Monday to around 300%, from about 210% Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers predicted a much calmer week ahead of Christmas holiday, following hectic trade last week when the leu's fast fall was stopped only after the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold more than $60 million last week to slow the leu's depreciation, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers also said the rates on money market will remain at high levels as banks want to take advantage of winter holidays. \par \par \uc2  A dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also interested in keeping rates high to divert banks' attention from the dollar and save its \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped to $1.85 billion at the end of November from $2.04 a month earlier. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0857GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917ducl028at\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
