\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Shrs End Week Dn Ahead Of Holiday;Index -5.2% \b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 1998\par 18:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--Shares on the Bucharest Stock Exchange closed lower Friday with investors showing little interest ahead of the Christmas holiday, brokers said. \par \par \uc2  The Bucharest Stock Exchange composite index, the BET-C, closed at 478.56, down 26.48 points, or 5.2%, from last Friday's close. Average daily volume was around 3.5 billion lei ($1=ROL10,615), almost unchanged from last week. \par \par \uc2  A broker with a foreign brokerage firm in Bucharest said investors weren't interested in buying stocks ahead of winter holidays. He also said some investors were worried by the leu's instability and were selling stocks to buy dollars. \par \par \uc2  Earlier this week, the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the leu's fast fall, selling more than $60 million on the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  quoted its reference rate Friday for the dollar at ROL10,615, up ROL95, or 0.9%, from last week. \par \par \uc2  Foreign investors continued to show no interest in Romanian stocks, unconvinced that the government has acted to implement market reforms. Prime Minister Radu Vasile promised earlier this month to close some money-losing companies by Dec. 20 but so far no action has been taken. \par \par \uc2  The closures are a precondition for a new standby agreement with the International Monetary Fund. IMF support is seen as essential in helping Romania to avoid defaulting in 1999, when $2.2 billion in foreign debts must be paid. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 18-12-98 \par \par \uc2  1711GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duci024xk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
