\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Lower Vs Dollar Early; Seen Stabilizing \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 1998\par 09:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday on some dollar demand from banks, although the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is expected to stabilize at lower levels, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL10,575 and ROL10,630, down from between ROL10,490 and ROL10,540 at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu declined in early trading on dollar buying orders from banks seeking to cover hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions. He said the move follows banks' sale of dollars Wednesday when they bought lei to take advantage of high rates on the money market. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to around 250% early Thursday from 225% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Thursday's calm trading followed a major \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen selling about $50 million to halt the leu's sharp fall against the dollar on speculative trading from some banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the appointment by parliament of a new board for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to have an impact on the leu. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Mugur Isarescu was appointed to another six-year term in his post. \par \par \uc2  Isarescu is expected to maintain strict control over inflation and to allow only a modest depreciation of the leu. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197retzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0829GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duch0274o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
