\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  c. bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to temper leu fall. \b0\par\par\uc2 184 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 1998\par 14:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Dec 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in midday trading on Thursday, selling moderate amounts of dollars to temper a fall in the leu, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR stepped in after the leu had plunged to around 10,650/80 from Wednesday's close of 10,470/500 to the dollar. Banks' purchases were mainly linked to weekend money deals," said one dealer with a foreign bank. "There were also hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  buy orders from seasonal importers." \par \par \uc2  The leu firmed toward 10,520/600 to the dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  but slipped later to near 10,560/610. The unit had opened weaker at 10,570/630, dealers said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials were unavailable to comment. \par \par \uc2  On the money market, overnight and one-week rates were at 190/230 percent and 250/300 percent against Wednesday's 220/245 percent and 260/280 percent. ((Radu Marinas, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). REUTERS. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926duch025w2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
