\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Stronger Vs Dlr Early;Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Tue \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1998\par 09:25\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly stronger against the dollar early Wednesday in calm trading following a major \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0755 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL10,410 and ROL10,510, down from between ROL10,450 and ROL10,550 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was said to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sold dollars Tuesday to calm the leu's sharp fall on speculative trading from some banks, said a dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. The dealer estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $50 million when the dollar was trading at more than ROL10,700. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said there was no reason for the leu's rapid slide against the dollar as the pressure from importers was low and rates on the money market were extremely high. \par \par \uc2  "The (\b \highlight22\uc2 central) bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  caused the market to return to normal," a dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He predicted the leu will follow a slow depreciation trend over the next few days and will end the year in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  estimation of ROL10,600 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to around 225% early Wednesday, from 200% Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones N