\par\par \b \uc2  C. Bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  halts leu plunge. \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 1998\par 16:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  1410 GMT - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's leu plunged to 10,740/800 to the dollar in mid-day trading on Tuesday amid large hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases but firmed to about 10,500/600 at close from 10,690/790 the previous day, after \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  * Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) had stepped on the interbank market and sold significant dollar amounts after it dived amid large purchases by banks extending hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions and by various importers. \par \par \uc2  The leu was hoisted initially to near 10,470/550, but later yielded some of its gains as dollar demand remained high, operators said. \par \par \uc2  "I think the unit's up and down moves throughout the day were the largest in recent months," said one dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest. "The BNR had refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  over the past few days." \par \par \uc2  * Most dealers said the leu was likely to stay clear of the 11,000 level in the next two weeks. \par \par \uc2  * On the money market, overnight and one-week rates were at 160/210 percent against Monday's 150/180 percent and 160/200 percent. \par \par \uc2  * Traders were waiting for the results of Tuesday's auction 500 billion lei in 28-days T-bills. They were reluctant to predict the yields of the issue but said it might be undersubscribed. \par \par \uc2  * Leu-dollar retail prices slipped to 10,680/880 from 10,650/850 the previous day. \par \par \uc2  ((Radu Marinas, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926ducf02ds3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
