\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to prop up leu. \b0\par\par\uc2 179 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Dezember 1998\par 10:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Dec 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in mid-day trading on Tuesday, selling large amounts of dollars to temper the leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fast decline, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the leu had dived to around 10,740/800 to the dollar amid large purchases," said one dealer with a foreign bank. "The increased pressure came from banks going long on hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and from various importers." \par \par \uc2  The leu firmed toward 10,470/550 to the dollar after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The unit opened slightly firmer at 10,685/760 against Monday's close of around 10,690/790. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials were not immediately available to comment. \par \par \uc2  On the money market, overnight and one-week rates rose to 160/200 percent and 170/210 percent against Monday's 150/180 percent and 160/200 percent respectively. ((Radu Marinas, Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). REUTERS. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926ducf02dit\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
