\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Lower Early Vs Dlr; Calm Session Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Dezember 1998\par 09:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar in calm trading early Friday with dealers predicting little change over the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL10,530 and ROL10,550, up from between ROL10,505 and ROL10,530 at Thursday close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Romania said the market has calmed after Thursday's stormy session, when the leu fell rapidly on dollar demand from banks. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, an action it has taken on several occasions over the past few weeks, and sold small amounts of dollars to halt the leu's depreciation. Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also attracted leu deposits at high rates, to divert banks' attention from investing in dollars. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to around 130% early Friday, from 100% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers see the dollar at about ROL10,600 at the end of 1998, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  maintaining tight control over the rate of the leu's depreciation. \par \par \uc2  However, analysts are concerned that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is wasting too much of its reserves on supporting the leu against the dollar. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped to $1.85 billion at the end of November from $2.04 billion at end-October. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 11-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0836GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917ducb022g6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
