erves at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  dropped to $1.85 billion at the end of November from $2.04 billion at end-October. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0829GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duca01y1j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
