\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Up Vs Dlr Early, Recovers From Mon's Weakness \b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Dezember 1998\par 09:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is higher against the dollar early Tuesday, recovering after Monday's fall on profit-taking. \par \par \uc2  At 0805 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL10,350 and ROL10,380, down from between ROL10,370 and ROL10,400 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Romania said pressure on the leu has abated in early trading following the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday. \par \par \uc2  He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday both on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and on the money markets to slow the leu's rapid depreciation caused by profit taking. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars for lei as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded above ROL10,410 and attracted leu deposits at overnight rates between 140%-160% in order to divert banks' from investing in dollars and to soften the leu's fall. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said the leu's weaker trend against the dollar is likely to resume in the coming days, albeit at a slower pace. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to around 130% early Tuesday, from 100% Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-12-98 \par \par \uc2  0836GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duc801w0c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\pic