\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to temper leu fall. \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 1998\par 09:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST, Nov 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BNR) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the local interbank market in early trading on Thursday, selling moderate amounts of dollars to temper a leu \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  downswing, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The BNR stepped in after the leu had weakened to quotes of 10,180/205 to the dollar," said a dealer with a private bank. "Pressure came from some players trying to adjust positions." \par \par \uc2  The leu firmed towards 10,135/165 to the dollar immediately after the BNR moves but trades now softer at about 10,150/175. The unit opened the day lower at 10,170/200 against 10,130/150. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials declined to comment. \par \par \uc2  The leu breached the sensitive 10,000 barrier on Monday on a calm market and has slipped towards 10,130/150 levels in recent days, with the BNR refraining from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to cap its slide. \par \par \uc2  Short-term money market rates hovered at about 50/75 percent on overnight and 50/90 for one-week funds. \par \par \uc2  Leu-dollar prices at licensed exchange bureaux bobbed at about 10,060/270 against 10,050/230 the previous day. ((Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 312-0264, fax +40 1 315-8448, bucharest.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010926dubq03lb5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
