\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early On Increasing Dlr Demand \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 November 1998\par 09:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Wednesday on increasing dollar demand from both banks and importers, in a trend that dealers predict will continue throughout the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0745 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL10,120 and ROL10,140, up from between ROL10,075 and ROL10,105 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu's depreciation had increased over the past day on rising dollar demand from banks that fear a further fall in the leu. The pressure from importers' dollar buying orders has also contributed to the leu's depreciation. \par \par \uc2  The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to calm the depreciation, and its reference exchange rate Tuesday quoted the dollar at more than ROL10,000 for the first time. \par \par \uc2  Some \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the lack of reaction from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was a sign of caution after \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves decreased to less than $2 billion in the past month. They said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market, setting high leu rates to attract leu deposits and divert banks from the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Mugur Isarescu said the leu is expected to depreciate by 5% against the dollar by the end of the year, but dealers said the current depreciation trend could see the leu falling more than that. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 25-11-98 \par \par \uc2  0817GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dubp01i6n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
