\par\par \b \uc2  Romanian Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Seen Stable \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 November 1998\par 09:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is slightly lower against the dollar early Wednesday, with dealers predicting little movement by the end of the session. \par \par \uc2  At 0820 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,830 and ROL9,860, up from between ROL9,820 and ROL9,845 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  Calm trading early Wednesday follows a stormy session Tuesday when the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell dollars to halt the leu's slide. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu depreciated fast Tuesday amid banks' fears of a further fall. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  then \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell small amounts of dollars as the dollar was traded between ROL9,860 and ROL9,900. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman said the leu depreciation was artificial, with banks reacting mainly to rumors. He predicted the market will return to normal very soon. \par \par \uc2  The unit depreciated 1.38% Tuesday, and dealers predict the depreciation will continue in the coming days, but at a slower rate and under tight control from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would let the leu slide to try to reduce the trade deficit that has widened to $2.01 billion in the first eight months of the year from $1.49 billion a year earlier. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate remained at 85% early in the session esday, the same as Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-11-98 \par \par \uc2  0854GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dub400rxo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
