\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Romania \highlight\uc2  Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early; Ctrl Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 November 1998\par 09:41\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Tuesday and the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to halt the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slide, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0815 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,775 and ROL9,860, up from between ROL9,770 and ROL9,800 at Monday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu continued to depreciate fast in early trading amid fears of a further fall. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  then \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sold small amounts of dollars as the dollar was traded between ROL9,860 and ROL9,900. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers were puzzled in the early session by the lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday. \par \par \uc2  The unit has depreciated 0.83% Monday and dealers predicted the depreciation would continue in the coming days. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would let the leu slide to try to reduce the trade deficit that has widened to $2.01 billion in the first eight months of the year from $1.49 billion a year-earlier. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  several times and selling small amounts of dollars to slow the leu's depreciation. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to 85% early in the session Tuesday from 75% Monday, with dealers predicting the rate might go higher if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decides to help the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by attracting leu deposits with high rates. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 03-11-98 \par \par \uc2  0841GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917dub300qgf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
