\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Steady Vs Dlr Early; Little Movement seen \b0\par\par\uc2 222 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 1998\par 09:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is steady against the dollar early Friday, with dealers predicting little movement over the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0645 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,365 and ROL9,380, the same as Thursday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu is likely to remain around its current level, with banks attracted more by the money market. \par \par \uc2  He said there was no pressure on the leu from importers' dollar demand. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to 120% early Friday, from 115% Thursday, with banks continuing to attract leu deposits at high rates. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the leu has depreciated in the past two days with banks buying and selling dollars in spot trade with payment in two days, to take advantage of high rates on the money market. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue its downward trend in coming weeks, depreciating by 3% per month until the end of the year. The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  is poised to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop any major moves. \par \par \uc2  Last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $30 million when the dollar rose to about ROL9,400. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0711GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duag0067w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picsc