\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Lower Vs Dlr Early As Bks Push Overnight Rate Up \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1998\par 09:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is lower against the dollar early Thursday as banks sell leu for dollars to force a higher overnight money market rate, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0640 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,345 and ROL9,380, up from ROL9,320 and ROL9,350 at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate rose to 115% early Thursday, from 70% Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu has depreciated with banks buying and selling dollars in spot trade with payment in two days. He said this has become normal for the end of the week as banks want to take advantage of high rates on the money market. \par \par \uc2  Anther dealer said that some dollar repatriation was noticed Wednesday, which increased pressure on the leu. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers predicted the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue its downward trend in coming weeks, depreciating by 3% per month until the end of the year. The National Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\uc2  is poised to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop any major moves. \par \par \uc2  Last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $30 million when the dollar rose to about ROL9,400. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market last week, attracting leu deposits at high rates in order to divert funds from the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0733GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010920duaf008s6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
