\par\par \b \uc2  Romania Leu Stronger Vs Dollar Early But Seen Depreciating \b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Oktober 1998\par 09:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BUCHAREST (Dow Jones)--The Romanian leu (ROL) is stronger against the dollar early Wednesday but dealers predict the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will resume its slow depreciation. \par \par \uc2  At 0640 GMT, the dollar was trading between ROL9,320 and ROL9,340, down from ROL9,350 and ROL9,360 at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  A dealer with a foreign bank in Bucharest said the leu's appreciation is "relative" as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  corrects the decline seen at Tuesday's close. \par \par \uc2  "There was no pressure on the leu on Tuesday," he said adding that the depreciation was caused by some last minute transactions. \par \par \uc2  Another dealer predicted the leu would continue its downward trend in the coming weeks but said no major move is expected this week. \par \par \uc2  Dealers say that the leu will depreciate by 3% per month against the dollar until the end of the year, with the National bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Romania\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop any major moves. \par \par \uc2  Last week the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around $30 million when the dollar rose to about ROL9,400. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was also seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the money market last week, attracting leu deposits at high rates in order to divert funds from the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The leu's liquidity is low, with a ROL1.1 trillion three-month Treasury bill auction late Tuesday draining more lei from the market. \par \par \uc2  The average yield in the undersubscribed auction was 56.36%, up from 55% last week. \par \par \uc2  The overnight money market rate remained at 70% Tuesday, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Cristi Cretzan; (401) 210-8197; ccretzan@\b \highlight22\uc2 fx\b0 \highlight\uc2 .ro \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0733GMT \par \par \uc2  1869 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duae004dz\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Romania near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\cl